  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9c3878f6-fbb6-4648-83a7-e2ef43e94238-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 177px;\" /></p><p>For the wire to remain stationary, the net force acting on it should be zero.</p><p>Balancing the forces along the incline,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>L</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
